# NOTE: course data ships in the repo (clone-and-run). The lesson-level
# CODE/.gitignore files demonstrate real-repo behavior (ignoring data/.env)
# and are taught inside the lessons.

# Bulk course data is hosted on Kaggle (see data/README.md); keep the repo
# lean by NOT committing the large per-month CSV files or the upload zip.
data/*.csv
data/kaggle_upload/*.zip
data/kaggle_upload/*.ipynb